WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Really respectful

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,400
Give me your birthday and horoscope

3
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:04,130
He will come tonight

4
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:06,330
Beat the gongs and drums, and the Eight Tai Dajiao will pick you up.

5
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,410
I'll draw a rune for you

6
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:08,450
Put it under the pillow

7
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:10,130
Put a pair of scissors on it and remember

8
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:11,210
while dreaming

9
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,530
No matter what anyone tells you

10
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:24,370
Don't answer a word to Old Liu. What's going on? Don't make a sound. Listen to my wife.

11
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:25,570
I'm here to pick you up

12
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:27,970
We are finally getting married

13
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,490
Madam, come with me

14
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,890
I'll take you towards a better life

15
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,290
Why don't you open your eyes and look at me?

16
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:43,170
Are you tired of seeing this face? Madam?

17
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:44,970
Do you like this face?

18
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:47,910
Don't speak anymore

19
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:49,710
I'll cut you into pieces

20
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:52,190
Hold it back

21
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:53,790
Can't answer a word

22
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:55,390
He answered and was taken away by him
